# Boehm GC 验证：循环分配临时数组（GC 回收）+ 显式 free（GC_free 路径）
class Main()

int[] keep = [1, 2, 3]
for (int i = 0; i < 100000; i++) {
    int[] tmp = [i, i + 1]
    if (tmp[0] < 0) {
        Stdout.println("never")
    }
}
Stdout.println(keep.length())
Stdout.println(keep[2])
free keep
Stdout.println("gc ok")
